  "description": "# Daily precipitation product\nDaily precipitation (P) data at 1 km spatial resolution - Data are obtained by downscaling CPC and GPM-LR data to 1 km spatial resolution using CHELSA climatology and merging them through a triple collocation technique on CPC GPM and ERA5\n",
